"00:22.664">I </span><span begin="00:22.664" end="00:23.713">try </span><span begin="00:23.713" end="00:24.229">not </span><span begin="00:24.229" end="00:24.502">to </span><span begin="00:24.502" end="00:25.146">move</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.885" end="00:28.899"><span begin="00:25.885" end="00:26.046">A </span><span begin="00:26.046" end="00:26.694">fight </span><span begin="00:26.694" end="00:26.849">I </span><span begin="00:26.849" end="00:27.884">always </span><span begin="00:27.884" end="00:28.899">lose</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.505" end="00:33.446"><span begin="00:29.505" end="00:30.924">Time </span><span begin="00:30.924" end="00:31.259">always </span><span begin="00:31.259" end="00:31.988">seems </span><span begin="00:31.988" end="00:32.199">to </span><span begin="00:32.199" end="00:32.892">find </span><span begin="00:32.892" end="00:33.024">a </span><span begin="00:33.024" end="00:33.446">way</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.755" end="00:39.143"><span begin="00:34.755" end="00:35.313">Oh-</span><span begin="00:35.313" end="00:35.877">oh </span><span begin="00:36.276" end="00:36.455">it's </span><span begin="00:36.455" end="00:37.479">not </span><span begin="00:38.139" end="00:38.321">the </span><span begin="00:38.321" end="00:39.143">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.995" end="00:42.365"><span begin="00:39.995" end="00:40.147">I </span><span begin="00:40.147" end="00:40.669">miss </span><span begin="00:40.669" end="00:40.988">you </span><span begin="00:40.988" end="00:41.643">every </span><span begin="00:41.643" end="00:42.365">day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.395" end="00:47.789"><span begin="00:43.395" end="00:43.878">Still </span><span begin="00:43.878" end="00:44.428">some </span><span begin="00:44.428" end="00:45.190">things </span><span begin="00:45.190" end="00:45.355">I </span><span begin="00:45.355" end="00:45.876">wish </span><span begin="00:45.876" end="00:46.060">I </span><span begin="00:46.060" end="00:46.537">told </span><span begin="00:46.537" end="00:47.789">ya</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.274" end="00:53.057"><span begin="00:50.274" end="00:51.449">Can't </span><span begin="00:52.021" end="00:52.307">you </span><span begin="00:52.307" end="00:53.057">stay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.874" end="00:56.421"><span begin="00:53.874" end="00:54.221">Why'd </span><span begin="00:54.221" end="00:54.380">you </span><span begin="00:54.380" end="00:55.451">go </span><span begin="00:55.451" end="00:56.421">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.379" end="01:01.403"><span begin="00:57.379" end="00:57.851">Hope </span><span begin="00:57.851" end="00:58.364">that </span><span begin="00:58.364" end="00:58.813">we </span><span begin="00:58.813" end="00:59.029">can </span><span begin="00:59.029" end="00:59.762">do </span><span begin="00:59.762" end="00:59.958">it </span><span begin="00:59.958" end="01:01.403">over</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.747" end="01:10.352"><span begin="01:07.747" end="01:07.920">I </span><span begin="01:07.920" end="01:09.167">cried </span><span begin="01:09.167" end="01:09.412">and </span><span begin="01:09.412" end="01:09.588">I </span><span begin="01:09.588" end="01:10.352">begged</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.105" end="01:13.928"><span begin="01:11.105" end="01:11.307">Take </span><span begin="01:11.307" end="01:12.310">someone </span><span begin="01:12.310" end="01:12.692">else </span><span begin="01:12.692" end="01:13.928">instead</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.002" end="01:18.497"><span begin="01:15.002" end="01:16.245">Not </span><span begin="01:16.245" end="01:16.657">that </span><span begin="01:16.657" end="01:16.849">he </span><span begin="01:16.849" end="01:17.910">listens </span><span begin="01:17.910" end="01:18.497">anyway</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.705" end="01:24.321"><span begin="01:21.705" end="01:22.971">Stairs </span><span begin="01:22.971" end="01:23.178">I </span><span begin="01:23.178" end="01:23.585">can't </span><span begin="01:23.585" end="01:24.321">tread</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.948" end="01:27.394"><span begin="01:24.948" end="01:25.295">So </span><span begin="01:25.295" end="01:25.473">you </span><span begin="01:25.473" end="01:25.641">go </span><span begin="01:25.641" end="01:26.240">on </span><span begin="01:26.619" end="01:27.394">ahead</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.622" end="01:32.388"><span begin="01:28.622" end="01:30.007">Oh </span><span begin="01:30.007" end="01:30.199">I </span><span begin="01:30.199" end="01:30.428">know </span><span begin="01:30.428" end="01:30.844">you </span><span begin="01:30.844" end="01:31.113">won't </span><span begin="01:31.113" end="01:31.922">mind </span><span begin="01:31.922" end="01:32.069">the </span><span begin="01:32.069" end="01:32.388">wait</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.792" end="01:38.266"><span begin="01:33.792" end="01:34.476">Oh-</span><span begin="01:34.476" end="01:35.009">oh </span><span begin="01:35.499" end="01:35.658">it's </span><span begin="01:35.658" end="01:36.579">not </span><span begin="01:37.135" end="01:37.313">the </span><span begin="01:37.313" end="01:38.266">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.887" end="01:41.443"><span begin="01:38.887" end="01:39.075">I </span><span begin="01:39.075" end="01:39.579">miss </span><span begin="01:39.579" end="01:39.989">you </span><span begin="01:39.989" end="01:40.625">every </span><span begin="01:40.625" end="01:41.443">day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.318" end="01:46.667"><span begin="01:42.318" end="01:43.020">Still </span><span begin="01:43.020" end="01:43.553">some </span><span begin="01:43.553" end="01:44.071">things </span><span begin="01:44.071" end="01:44.270">I </span><span begin="01:44.270" end="01:44.777">wish </span><span begin="01:44.777" end="01:44.988">I </span><span begin="01:44.988" end="01:45.997">told </span><span begin="01:45.997" end="01:46.667">ya</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.400" end="01:52.276"><span begin="01:49.400" end="01:50.523">Can't </span><span begin="01:50.976" end="01:51.466">you </span><span begin="01:51.466" end="01:52.276">stay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.929" end="01:55.481"><span begin="01:52.929" end="01:53.502">Why'd </span><span begin="01:53.502" end="01:53.698">you </span><span begin="01:53.698" end="01:54.373">go </span><span begin="01:54.373" end="01:55.481">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.355" end="02:02.681"><span begin="01:56.355" end="01:57.005">Hope </span><span begin="01:57.005" end="01:57.216">that </span><span begin="01:57.216" end="01:58.547">we </span><span begin="01:59.491" end="02:00.311">can </span><span begin="02:00.311" end="02:01.497">do </span><span begin="02:01.497" end="02:01.710">it </span><span begin="02:01.710" end="02:02.681">over</span></p></div></body></tt>